-            //   n_predict/2 - measured need: at -n 128 the 3*seg_max cap alone let opener +
-            //                 3 extensions consume all 128 tokens and the routed expert was
-            //                 handed a zero budget ([seg 3] author=expert tokens=0). The
-            //                 routed tier must always own the majority of a hard answer.
+        if (!opener_text.empty() && opener_enabled(s) && p.hard_mode != "verify") {
             // A segment is only started when seg_min tokens still fit, so the cap is never
